      "decision": "needs_evidence",
      "conclusion": "Original Swatch exact SSX03W100N page identifies Royal Pop Huit Blanc and a hand-wound version of SISTEM51, distinct from the conventional automatic SISTEM51. White dial, white Bioceramic case, multicoloured bezel screws; central seconds. Manufacturer model specifications: 40mm diameter, 8.4mm thickness, Bioceramic, sapphire front and transparent rear, calfskin lanyard. Original model gallery and macro pixels inspected: accepted dial detail, movement through the decorated display back, and stitched lanyard attachment detail. The same rear photograph serves movement and caseback categories and must be suppressed in External mode. A display-back photograph is not an opened-case inspection. The lanyard category does not depict a metal bracelet or folding clasp. Product cutouts and small previews excluded from accepted photography; no full-face photograph accepted in this pass. No generic automatic SISTEM51 photograph, technical supplier code, production interval or individual-watch authenticity inferred. Recorded V8 codes and model-name entries are not established calibre designations; retain execution review. SSX03W101 without N is not accepted as SSX03W101N; RoyalPop as an entered brand is not silently remapped. Other colourways and suffixes remain distinct. Nominal water resistance does not test the user watch.",
